Cell["\<\
A member of a polyline is one member of each piece, joined. So the \
cardinality of a polyline is the product of the cardinalities of its pieces, \
and its length is the sum of their lengths.\
\>", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"24bc9119-9aa8-49f5-a37d-959bad2d6a08"],

Cell["Corresponding notions in the classical axiom systems:", "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"db75fdfe-0fcb-4eb0-84cb-b446d7b087d0"],

